# Binary assets (sample art, sprites): never line-ending converted or text-diffed.
# Deliberately not Git LFS: a package installed from a Git URL on a machine without git-lfs
# would get LFS pointer files instead of models, textures and sounds.
*.fbx binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.unitypackage binary

# Shell scripts run on Linux CI runners and in Git Bash: keep LF line endings.
*.sh text eol=lf
